<title>USA: Big Smith Brands says court denies appeal.</title>
<headline>Big Smith Brands says court denies appeal.</headline>
<dateline>CARTHAGE, Mo. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Smith Brands Inc said Tuesday a court had denied its appeal of ruling that Caterpillar Inc properly terminated a licensing agreement with Big Smith.  </p>
<p>Big Smith said the U.S. Seventh Circuit Court of Appeals denied the company's petition for permission to appeal the lower court ruling.</p>
